  </div>
  <button class="m21-btn" onclick="MMTF21.create90DayPlan()">建立 30／60／90 天任務</button><div id="m21-plan-result"></div>
 </div>
 <div class="m21-wrap" id="m21-module-8"><div class="m21-head"><h2>模組八｜前後測與組織變化趨勢</h2><span class="m21-badge">方向判讀，不宣稱因果</span></div>
  <div class="m21-grid">
   <div class="m21-field"><label>T1 Mirror／Matrix／Flow／Safety</label><input id="m21-t1" placeholder="例如 9,13,8,5"></div>
   <div class="m21-field"><label>T2 Mirror／Matrix／Flow／Safety</label><input id="m21-t2" placeholder="例如 12,14,10,8"></div>
   <div class="m21-field"><label>可比性檢查</label><select id="m21-comparable"><option value="no">尚未確認／不可比</option><option value="yes">題項、計分、抽樣與施測條件可比</option></select></div>
   <div class="m21-field"><label>同期外部事件</label><input id="m21-external-events" placeholder="人力異動、旺季、制度變更等"></div>
  </div>
  <button class="m21-btn" onclick="MMTF21.compareTimepoints()">計算前後測趨勢</button><div id="m21-trend-result"></div>
  <div class="m21-note">分數上升／下降只描述觀察變化；未經適當統計檢定，不使用「顯著改善／顯著退步」。無對照組或準實驗設計，不推論介入造成變化。</div>
